@JasonJShuler 
You are more than welcome to join the group of volunteers who are maintaining xDrip.
Do you have time, and interest, to create a list and answer corresponding questions, and be criticized for being inefficient?

@JasonJShuler I can answer some of your questions, if not all, if you ask them using the right channels, mentioned already at the top.

The issues platform is for bringing to the attention of the developers what needs their attention.
I am more than happy to talk to you about what we are doing for documentation and how you can help.
